  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide protection assistance to affected and at-risk populations with focus on vulnerable women and girls. This UNFPA project provides GBV prevention, mitigation, and response interventions for affected people. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 64,774 people, including 40,417 women, 16,395 girls and 1,295 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
